# tally 2.1.8 R14 (item 74), L §5.10, §8.4: gap reads the reading its instant gives; EUR's and PLN's both stand at
# 2026-02-15 end, so it is refused RUN-DOMAIN, never one unit's gap picked in silence.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
kind wallets: place any signed
place broker: wallets lives 2025-01-01..

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  anchor broker
  opening[broker] = 1.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[broker] = 2.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[broker] = 4.00 EUR at 2026-02-15 end "s"
  stated[broker] = 10.00 PLN at 2026-02-15 end "s"

ask g: gap(broker, 2026-02-15)
=== expect
g: refused: RUN-DOMAIN gap of broker: its readings at 2026-02-15 end are in EUR and PLN
  cut 2026-06-10
